WEBVTT

00:04:59.288 --> 00:05:04.621
as my father slipped from the world from
May to July to September to November.

00:05:04.871 --> 00:05:08.871
I went about with my usual smile.
I didn't drop a single grade.

00:05:09.871 --> 00:05:13.413
When asked how he's doing, I
would shrug and say, OK,

00:05:14.454 --> 00:05:20.204
I was praised for being strong,
I was the master of being OK.

00:05:21.829 --> 00:05:23.496
But back home, we struggled.

00:05:23.538 --> 00:05:26.663
My father hadn't been able to keep his
small business going during his illness,

00:05:27.246 --> 00:05:30.204
and my mother alone was grieving
the love of her life,